  "operative_text": "Section 1 (constitutional amendment, new article I, section 18): A well regulated militia, being necessary to the security of a free state, the right of the people to keep and bear arms, shall not be infringed.\nSection 2 (submission to voters): The proposed amendment must be submitted to the people at the 2024 general election."
